Subject: how to use only data from another package
Message-ID: <me-cJWRmQo0.iMTpTUGqkzgJ@rdevtools.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rdevtools/c/me-cJWRmQo0/m/iMTpTUGqkzgJ>
